{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 593,
  "batch_count": 1662,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0513553da490a692523f45b5f779f99f6cb7e34",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adae6bec26ff3a58c8ee8bd8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会吃加了很多肉的炒豆芽菜！\\n训练员！就拜托你准备好钱包啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c8e0c4765bc88ddf720b85ed95ab23ee8d3cfdcf3d80bf5a0a956bcc866290c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "712"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dba36b5e8ea58ed690229a6c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要笑就趁现在吧～\\n反正很快就会让你们哭出来啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11bbd3e91580eb2ab5db68f6dc7b9e027e15c576d128574ebdc9bde706b3d593",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "713"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0fedb7fbe49b840d663837a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想尽自己的全力去跑……\\n好让这场比赛成为在日本经历过的重要回忆！",
      "source_fingerprint": "51e65958b25400ae07c12dbdccedc5c54a31e8eeb90d45160d7e14e1f0caf2a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "714"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6376a0be4691b94650ae72eb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我有时也会自豪地赌上\\n包括自信与干劲的一切而跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c8000d64f7ebe6cfc0c8093cdd4c9a7ddb46e79342b45742928cb4b623d2d86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "715"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f521e99535523e5e3df552a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是为了获得常胜的理论，以及……\\n能够选择继续跑下去的支柱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33e361772eeb06004697bfdb1f3af1d8dcf928648e7fb627d0a7cc13a17de867",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "716"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7635dca6da15e19b1fa6b4b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身边有个不得了的怪物存在……\\n不断困扰着我呢，但也因此才有现在的我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fd1e3b9dd8e97f6b3ba9a0260f6954b3c46209f0120a38ea18998dee2fafb72",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "717"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f54117ca22680c6b638b230",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好期待～♪我想她应该会那样跑，\\n而她一定会……嗯～好想赶快开始跑喔──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e3ef83dae074f686ad47d465467864f67fb16ca0de1dafb834742332f8375dc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "718"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41d13b6fdc63775ea1fb5bc6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "毕竟训练员有帮我加油啊☆\\n我比平常更不觉得会输呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1f96366a022dceb5fd456d59d94a1aa529797d4f1a04768a72b230b31f65894",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "719"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:403438ebc1b7a1c7e11c3b28",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯～人家才该被特别留意吧♪\\n如何……？刚才那样回答很成熟吧──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e9c0963fc31fafdf09fdbee0f23434c58e4bc3c8a97e232a68dfa12f0818aca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "72"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:018690df088a2badfc453b5e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "干劲也要……用高压萃取法。\\n使尽地，把它们浓缩起来……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9378b6b02e4afa46b9fd2be4768c539067d86d704e3c53db11a7a58e88ca60d2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "720"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0faeae314e6da610bfa111ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我不会……把第1让出来。可以比我\\n更快抵达终点的……只有她……",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb1d1028204e87da7009faed98b77173f8fe99976eb3a6945b1eded926a800f8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "721"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2c6408e8ed4a3e02452cbf8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "胸口变得很热，就快要超载了。\\n……我很想赢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5e0c8f40dda806dd0d25447ac20e84b05ffa457c1b7cf049fcfc3af5db8ec58",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "722"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd349b5d43ad0f7857e865c0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "开始执行指令。嘻，呵……发生错误。\\n会在获得优胜后重新搜寻笑容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a86a78d8972e0c9d93cea8e817e74c1bbc29c90cf44fbbd422239114962d5aad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "723"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6957f818602ead880e78f711",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "已经在训练时拚尽全力落实每一下动作！\\n我会发挥那个成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1212603a21f110efdf43d7d4d950d746f8419547d6c2b7a9dbd100bb77d9c430",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "724"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:413f532860c310568f200f75",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "还是希望大家能看看这充满活力的肌肉！\\n因为它们是与我共同奋战的伙伴！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecb36c2b1cd42c84b0fc1a00db73bb08ca5de8b8db60d53906afc4641fd1d995",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "725"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff8e53607af9d1df43d2755e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "觉得非常期待♪因为认真一较高下后的\\n餐点会非常美味～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f785b0d004f34e033ce487094ff99de77969cbca75aa4b8ac25900cf0d869fea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "726"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbf9b1e825951d64036a30d8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Buono♪用尽全力较量过后，\\n大家相亲相爱来开火锅派对吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "532ec592f196c8dfd3bcbf463c3e63e95958acf0341abbd8eda548e982a05f3d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "727"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93c358f42a7c523d09c348f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哇啊！那我得挥挥手……不对。\\n我得全力以赴拿下第一名才行呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "649e2475d4972a335cca2e67d37aa28e8f67811850edc8b64a621d8283d28914",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "728"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dceff727dbf86fc52f83057",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然对手都很耀眼看起来又很强……\\n但我也不想输……我一定会赢的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48b420732878ece8cd727b8e8e0ba7281b8ba19452e7e5e15fd5c874b965ad6d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "729"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e33fb6d12758dd0b0c3b23d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "…………\\n我想追上……她的背影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "100baae54f3cc0e7a588db85a87c6a366ee7bbc3bb5a2dc27cc3d5a222e44e02",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "73"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fdf58c657316168e9ee8faf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……唔！那个、那个！米浴也有受到鼓励，\\n所以……好开心喔……嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41bb705e06125b2cd015c0975b4de38ecf484c83ca93f65c38acba27d44db7a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "730"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bae55467d07c44f8792d3052",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咦、咦、什么！？那个…………\\n…………都、都将由我收下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbcd1a7c84997b704e0a65fbcceb44ed1cfd76cd4ed38ecf773e1b623fb691db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "731"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c5821aa385118fbb7b9fc42",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯……不论是这场决赛还是竞赛后的\\n限时特卖都一定要获胜～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b82ea8faa9fa7df5deb40892db84067605479861d4b0422ef5c200023122701",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "732"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:150f561f24107306e554b403",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就连原本以为根本办不到的我，如今也\\n来到这里了。所以我会相信自己！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4069c974a625a3c49472d7220f22adea25f73d8e3b5a2cc7b2a359d3e65f08d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "733"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34084e4e0013f7d7fa32bb15",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是我试作的运动饮料。不过味道有问题，\\n难喝到像是异次元的物质。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38c35c5428b1afd55b570f0f3f122a1279871a4f386167e81cef2105375f7f4d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "734"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:883b119fd5823c00cea1dfcd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵，期待到受不了啊！超越极限、\\n肉体的可能性！感觉就要接近真理了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10ce5789d0fb692a91032e473024f6b2e0476aa9bc3c4c84e079fb4ea10675d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "735"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8412aa3f1a481a232987f6e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不用说我也会这么做。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7301e70162a0f140a53c893639138e5e0b87e379beca513dc361dd77bfb949b2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "736"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cdb0971e09bb13c6644d1f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "给重要的家人。\\n……希望今晚的夜空晴朗无云。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49b6eba04d92158f6bb6209d659047afff81148fb16a41501f7c1f0e817dcca8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "737"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09420498da39b274924901c1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀～真是绝景，绝景啊。\\n有值得打倒的对手在，让我跃跃欲试呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38623d8eb414fb95f3dfe1e7cf3e4d5bf007b27ebcfdc1212bf6dc72369c8c1b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "738"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ebb035b664e9fe948728e82",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没有！！因为那些话\\n就算没说出口也传达得出去嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9a3718add3dafe910e93e042696bf2cb742975c11ffb24f8e0bc210d4a38369",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "739"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:779ab6c47d6bfa22518be653",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……深焙的危地马拉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae97678893c38fa61993bd959e4b5b39a42f568be2c016e50b0f5ec7eaa58866",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "74"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b1cd0c472597f1f2b3b8556",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那时候当然是在心里大喊万岁──！\\n……咦？还是太棒啦──也说不定！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "44ea3ede6803fcd418da77b36b697ca6b3f1d9fc84e3aef36eccbdf5d68fe123",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "740"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:130ec5c1d57552ffc5a0e062",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "100%中的100%！\\n现在就能立刻起跑喔！不行吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "21e4be84ede1c773a727ed19218cb5be4f07129025d95e203c3619ab61bdc5bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "741"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fc17b522e91c765c3aa5f9f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你们也有精密计算过吧……不过，\\n我想到时候会要向上调整喔。不好意思啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7394812c11245634764ab0fe5239faf5f6d9df5502747f752768a4520fb0ddc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "742"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c89a2ce7dfea79c07a73db2b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你们就在我的手掌心中\\n努力挣扎吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e86d47c1a7e21c89f6ef04dea8381a88b2ab91dbda3648dd6d7930219932c2b4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "743"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef9ff04c5232437431ba30f8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为是最重要的机密事项，\\n请容我拒绝回答。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91b3151f50c6c1d4810fdfe8903eb6eea38411ca8d59957011428e450c1356f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "744"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3a6eb60d2d7031a51a54eee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "宛如落在避雷针上的Blitz，\\n会精准地穿破终点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c54ec5da22c7998fe93cd1a5fce5a640f8d7f6e2c97ac28c1fdacd4dfdff54a9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "745"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d33efbbd2383d3c9bb34b3b2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "非常开心……大家的声援，\\n让真机伶变得更加可爱了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8e8d4f649eb5148b38720025f30d9247536e0faef7500bd88e33efc3125696d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "746"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54bc47587f770bbc581646e4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的速度和可爱都是货真价实的。\\n立刻就会呼啸而过，所以别错过喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "545c03e3948acbf7d2add526e779c7058abd5dffc1454c37ffbeaf110eb7c41b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "747"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6b9bf1f53bb7e9f7cd6e197",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在这之中一定会有王子来……哦～呵呵呵呵，\\n我的心跳得好快，快到要爆炸了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecd8bf5efc073e8d12943cce7650c6fcf6351a381be56d1d4a6265abaecce436",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "748"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01d8daee39c20fb0fda3908c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身为公主……不，身为一个真正的公主，\\n要一路狂奔到胜者舞台！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19048128c4e76b0b7f1f4f56d76dfba50d8219078ac24e578d09b1f25e58d798",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "749"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11f6f2bc3f4384b71f38ee03",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……在黑暗的房间里…………一直待着……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b00c181a7ffa3042d862d9289ae6b4b1966200a9909684b8d5f248012d7eac3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "75"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86cb66fe788a2c15eebc33a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然也希望能关注我的表现，\\n不过我会带来精彩的竞赛，就好好期待吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09dcb62b842daa9806c7bb334587dadde334a1716b98b4af3dcddfb1dabc8d1a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "750"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffa89e95e6131cc6f2c72917",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会让观众的视线都集中到我身上，\\n并让这段访谈变成首页特辑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb591138bfee6de2d52c777ae0a13edd101960ae31e534a3030492a6631339ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "751"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41122c3c524c3888d6de8ea6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这问题问得好！虽然河堤和走廊也很难舍弃，\\n但最棒的地点还是……赛场上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66451511c11f5c405bae73d1a872ae72fdf5d62afc97ce81c5cf64e966070698",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "752"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ddaae02ead2c808181c3ce4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然！你问为什么？因为我是\\n立于强者之上的优等生！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4745590c0ff5fa9f9bbeafb9e8f24d49ba9780bbe2725d4bd514b7402023db0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "753"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17f0cd7209249bc7d20a3519",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "绕日本一圈的凯旋parade！\\n还能顺便吃本地盒饭，一石二鸟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d11c66f0298c3b302f1196e322d88fd2864a55119de0b5633eb06644c07c791a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "754"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be1d030adc8695c2d50ab2b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "久等了──showtime到啰！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b6cd34aa9fe35f555120b322348142dd93d7dad709edacdfb60d41b8d5aa208",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "755"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be110a7ae70aaa0dd836fb79",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "风风才没有紧张啦！所以现在……\\n希望你不要跟风风说话啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15a35549fc36169180aff12c0d718498029a79b8cac5c8a2b79d80d2b1d41d42",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "756"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bfa3e4b9d671ee3ae63def9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最后直线要是有人敢挡路……风风就在\\n那家伙屁股上留下超深的齿痕啦──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d55a314c337fb05469bfd162dc7bd346876b4e8bb8c4a249c6cae2714d7a9d0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "757"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccfd8c6278b7cbb029115486",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然她们具有相当程度的魔力，\\n但都不是我的对手呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca8a3055ad29fcd8848fb43cbfed2d82fb89a1070aee22a49cdd442db1775f56",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "758"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9eb601bed6248f679d426940",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然啰。就算在决赛时我也会让大家见识\\n魔法少女Sweepy的魔法。大爆炸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04dfe5615a08608b0ab8345d26039a28238dc6b8c82b31274ef777635db4e84b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "759"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3745a4558ff424009142003d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "电池已经充电完毕。\\n……我开玩笑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55a0e9493a9a7cc3e86bc2bea9c34361289e15dbd89812ae704d0d6ac695cf45",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "76"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4f4220728793278f8d1100b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员正在等待我的胜利。\\n……所以我要赢。绝对要赢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95ca6b43add6df0fd0603a918ce88f648a6b2f8b43896740659d0d4a3bb868db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "760"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57ed935c78bb41fa82a0fa10",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员的1日独占券吧。\\n真想疗愈再疗愈，尽情地疗愈他～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "753b2503efc2994e58135ff212c74fd9c120dc9caf8de96bfecc94fc06ee07cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "761"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:639f26c4ee4ca3f87c3664ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "今天的竞赛也会醒目地冲刺☆\\n让大家见识赛马娘偶像一路领先到底的潜力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "356df9d62048aa0c7a1c8373dd898997c08aff5f5e8da65bf211011ac365d6e7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "762"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c09d6a0c9d39424fd9d6894",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我绝对会赢，所以不能移开视线哟☆\\n要乖乖待在第一排正中央等喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4ee62b6e4a45e353f231fe5fcd56b0a71d275696c32464410e82e69b7e2165e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "763"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be1751a75e55630b076ed7cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的故事也终于来到最高潮……\\n为了有个圆满结局，我会努力的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13d77d74f67e7257d2059c82dfeb6a99248d7937b6c339e5890e3a92baeaf7e4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "764"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5444cfe99d3704a3be27983",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我、我是……主角！？那我说不定能成为\\n英雄……不对，是一定要成为英雄！",
      "source_fingerprint": "018b628cf07fd9af4a197b79e41f3a366d4a633bd9c0d08401b53d1a50573379",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "765"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09203252a4855f55a420e084",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这可不是佐敦玩笑，而是正经的喔～\\n不过啊，该说是这次让我也认真起来了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "067201b85dc0d828f0b691e654f58354e264538f932e92aa65183a2042dc96d2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "766"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01beef029cffe2ce47027563",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家真的都超强的耶～唉～真是的。\\n我不想输得很难看，那就只能获胜啰～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91a00ea0274caf4e2b1acd78522ab2693968d30484672b7f8c3c367ab36d0374",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "767"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72fe5589e82b7d63031d80c6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……根本压抑不住。\\n但没有问题……我现在感觉好极了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1321a0064c7ad137c19e01496c1a7dfd90d2d68e177bd4f98a060e0c0340465",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "768"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b61d83e824fb311c8e2312b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不会告诉任何人。\\n反正……应该有在看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "517d349961a16251b9fd3929fbeed109eee59aad053aa081d042573a49f58973",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "769"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee6778be54a2d894a7f2f416",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有时候会和朋友一起\\n「朝咖啡厅爆进──！」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cf47530fd79c632e99e495d6f56392905a80e8f0a99fc3947607df4d86b151a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "77"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d9fd83cee6f758c1418028f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跟谁啊……等赢了再考虑。\\n不先获胜就没意义了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f13dcb15e57c56f60197dfa8493020f831b180a4c4e8913f0845d2753e89580e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "770"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:420ed3dfbfe755e16d93882f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……我要赢。我会用胜利，\\n来证明自己很强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16f712d1f204db3c55d8b9199ce71eee5d02e9fd65a760c077137dfe3a144ae7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "771"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6531b34f2d04469688c19f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为有各位温暖的声援才使得花蕾开始绽放。\\n希望大家能在一旁守护花蕾盛开的瞬间！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5b7188283d4febe235bd01f5fe633706c5909b90d5f613aeb2adba675bd4931",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "772"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac848b5f23f486e1aedf961b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然就算踮起脚尖也还是不够，\\n但即便如此，我还是想追上大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28220b643431f80302071d8304c41fb202a852a7b20185c85747687632f0953c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "773"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e0388e5da9ce83f20252331",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这个嘛，我想要美国人在电视上说的\\n那个叫「小萝卜」的胡萝卜──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "776ba1ae8120f48a9464f49c4c673e5330f612ff71c62175767a6580ccbd2d3d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "774"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e88e773b053eaae18df75d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唔～蜜册是什么？怎么办──我没有耶！\\n没有就不能参加决赛吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e9061adfbb2c3a5ece874d02c64364aa14fa28ca6aa9c317b3352b02f30a6a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "775"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d67d006d1ebb2a43e6203290",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有句话说「赛马娘，一入闸门便有七敌」，\\n所以每个人都是劲敌！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20ef7f8fc8578115378c159b0bc058c5fef6222fa7a631c959ae9d2ac98fae04",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "776"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b76b1b9fbc48bbaa4950683c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "交给我吧！\\n呃嗯，我会像爆竹一样狂奔的──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2158a5ea888b3760f88a8dbedf94a8a3a9343412952efe50329eff493ee44f9d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "777"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5084a318d95382d0b673423",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ああ、まるでヒーローショーみたいだ……\\nピンチの時は応援よろしく頼む！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25937e356df896cb9500e8afcea848ad8bbc7d05b0fb75ac129d56460e565f7e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "778"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:269301d9b7c2713b5a73d9a1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "戦い続けるのみさ……。\\nそう、この世にレースがある限りッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5bd397b5eba10b332088310f1b71251c053ccc89706b14dcc9018c31931e008",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "779"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30e90e5b40800c285681c1fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "内存内是这么纪录着的，\\n「每一场都是蕴含庞大热能的激战」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a6f684bb2306b3a7d57ae93e3bef49a642fccd3b2e5b26c230a160331e07e92",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "78"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afdc9746d8ada86596276f2b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是美丽☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "75bafc61348b902c9dd1e5d672c19d1cef2a9842aa259500df190a35cce59f36",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "780"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7c92155992166667059e63a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯！尽～量期待吧！\\n我会将美丽传递给大家☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c4a4ba32f0066cb54c1fd2916508f5c7c97173fdda147d2f24b1795915e2a23",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "781"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5d672d70e02ec08cc894a78",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请收下这个「能与幽灵和肩膀酸痛成为朋友的\\n护身符」！这样就会变成甜蜜的负担吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58f19653df14c7eb942941a131ee9827b4eda7d0733d1bd6e090dde1b182761f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "782"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:668f18ab5e67370fa2d1adba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "运气！以及努力！于是我做完了\\n百次参拜！现在的我无懈可击！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21241b31dbe02baa525c6755966c738fb11c64959a53fad41f019a6f13b954df",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "783"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17994f3b9728e1fe1e71d419",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为欢呼声让人心旷神怡，我就忍不住睡了个\\n午觉，结果睡过头了。多亏如此我精神超好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b0221296f02ad2fbbb37f3fecd2bc6b9c9698adb636ff39c307edd6daa6f5ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "784"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
